From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:45:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 624/624] perf(v1,spec_decode): skip speculative drafting in
 steps where no request can use drafts

Port upstream vllm commit 856b98415b to skip drafting when every scheduled
request on every DP rank is either a non-final prefill chunk or guaranteed
to reach max_tokens on the current step (taking sink rejection draft_zero
into account). DFlash/DSpark and AutoRegressive speculators keep their draft
KV cache in sync on K=0 steps and skip the query pass, Markov sampling, and
CopyDrafter.
